    {
      "id": "1Zo07wEx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 312.78664676889287,
      "y": 2133.6196232024595,
      "width": 615.0196533203125,
      "height": 600,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b8s",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 560138212,
      "version": 811,
      "versionNonce": 1038863124,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794670591802,
      "created": 1794666158951,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirement:\n1) User should able to trade gold (buy/sell)\n2) User should able to see live gold price update\n3) User should able to see portfolio, assets\n4) System need a ledger for reconcile & accountability\n5) User should able to deposit & withdraw\n6) User should able show fees and confirmation before a trade\n7) Login and verification is needed.\n\nNon FR:\n1) Strong consistency\n2) 99.99% Availability\n3) Fail Close when network down\n4) Price refresh ~1s, <500ms order acceptance\n5) locked quote 30s window\n6) security \n7) durability (no ack trade is lost)\n8) 1M DAU, 200k trades/day, ~2.3 TPS avg, ~46 TPS peak\nCore Entities:\n- Transactions\n- Wallet\n- Ledger\n- Payment\n- User",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirement:\n1) User should able to trade gold (buy/sell)\n2) User should able to see live gold price update\n3) User should able to see portfolio, assets\n4) System need a ledger for reconcile & accountability\n5) User should able to deposit & withdraw\n6) User should able show fees and confirmation before a trade\n7) Login and verification is needed.\n\nNon FR:\n1) Strong consistency\n2) 99.99% Availability\n3) Fail Close when network down\n4) Price refresh ~1s, <500ms order acceptance\n5) locked quote 30s window\n6) security \n7) durability (no ack trade is lost)\n8) 1M DAU, 200k trades/day, ~2.3 TPS avg, ~46 TPS peak\nCore Entities:\n- Transactions\n- Wallet\n- Ledger\n- Payment\n- User",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "hasTextLink": false,
      "rawText": "Functional Requirement:\n1) User should able to trade gold (buy/sell)\n2) User should able to see live gold price update\n3) User should able to see portfolio, assets\n4) System need a ledger for reconcile & accountability\n5) User should able to deposit & withdraw\n6) User should able show fees and confirmation before a trade\n7) Login and verification is needed.\n\nNon FR:\n1) Strong consistency\n2) 99.99% Availability\n3) Fail Close when network down\n4) Price refresh ~1s, <500ms order acceptance\n5) locked quote 30s window\n6) security \n7) durability (no ack trade is lost)\n8) 1M DAU, 200k trades/day, ~2.3 TPS avg, ~46 TPS peak\nCore Entities:\n- Transactions\n- Wallet\n- Ledger\n- Payment\n- User"
    },
    {
      "id": "JNsVstmK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 977.9429779752243,
      "y": 2009.0980000477912,
      "width": 483.5797119140625,
      "height": 1025,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b8u",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 669581156,
      "version": 746,
      "versionNonce": 2042339675,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794668655626,
      "created": 1794668148794,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "API Design\nPOST /api/v1/trade/init\nHeader : Bearer JWT\nBody : {\n    amount, unit : MYR | GRAM\n    type : BUY | SELL\n}\n\nResponse : txid, fee, locked_price, quantity, total, expiry_time\n\nPOST /api/v1/trade/confirm\nHeader : Bearer JWT\nBody : { txid }\n202 Accepted : processing\n\nGET /api/v1/price/stream (SSE)\nLive price + timestamp (~1s)\n\nGET /api/v1/wallet\nHeader : Bearer JWT\n\nPOST api/v1/deposit\nHeader: Bearer JWT\nBody:{amount}\n\nPOST api/v1/withdraw\nHeader: Bearer JWT\nBody:{amount}\n\nPOST /api/v1/login\nPublic \nBody :{\n    username,\n     password\n}\n\n401 Unauthorized\n404 Not Found\n201 Created (quote)\n200 OK (read / completed replay)\n409 Conflict (expired quote / insufficient funds)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "API Design\nPOST /api/v1/trade/init\nHeader : Bearer JWT\nBody : {\n    amount, unit : MYR | GRAM\n    type : BUY | SELL\n}\n\nResponse : txid, fee, locked_price, quantity, total, expiry_time\n\nPOST /api/v1/trade/confirm\nHeader : Bearer JWT\nBody : { txid }\n202 Accepted : processing\n\nGET /api/v1/price/stream (SSE)\nLive price + timestamp (~1s)\n\nGET /api/v1/wallet\nHeader : Bearer JWT\n\nPOST api/v1/deposit\nHeader: Bearer JWT\nBody:{amount}\n\nPOST api/v1/withdraw\nHeader: Bearer JWT\nBody:{amount}\n\nPOST /api/v1/login\nPublic \nBody :{\n    username,\n     password\n}\n\n401 Unauthorized\n404 Not Found\n201 Created (quote)\n200 OK (read / completed replay)\n409 Conflict (expired quote / insufficient funds)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "hasTextLink": false,
      "rawText": "API Design\nPOST /api/v1/trade/init\nHeader : Bearer JWT\nBody : {\n    amount, unit : MYR | GRAM\n    type : BUY | SELL\n}\n\nResponse : txid, fee, locked_price, quantity, total, expiry_time\n\nPOST /api/v1/trade/confirm\nHeader : Bearer JWT\nBody : { txid }\n202 Accepted : processing\n\nGET /api/v1/price/stream (SSE)\nLive price + timestamp (~1s)\n\nGET /api/v1/wallet\nHeader : Bearer JWT\n\nPOST api/v1/deposit\nHeader: Bearer JWT\nBody:{amount}\n\nPOST api/v1/withdraw\nHeader: Bearer JWT\nBody:{amount}\n\nPOST /api/v1/login\nPublic \nBody :{\n    username,\n     password\n}\n\n401 Unauthorized\n404 Not Found\n201 Created (quote)\n200 OK (read / completed replay)\n409 Conflict (expired quote / insufficient funds)"
    },
