    {
      "id": "82f51188978a40f58470f0bf179526d0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3380,
      "y": 2140,
      "width": 640,
      "height": 650,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 604722652,
      "version": 27,
      "versionNonce": 1705752334,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794666129610,
      "created": 1794666124186,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "BUY Flow\n\n1) Init\n- Read current price; save quote, fees and expiry (30s).\n- Return txid and exact cash / gold amounts.\n\n2) Confirm [one DB transaction]\n- Lock trade, then wallet in consistent order.\n- Check owner, pending status, expiry and available cash.\n- Move cash from available to reserved.\n- Mark PROCESSING. Commit, then return 202.\n- A confirm retry returns the existing trade state.\n\n3) Worker -> Gold Provider\n- Read PROCESSING trades; use stable key per trade.\n- Timeout = unknown. Keep funds reserved.\n- Check provider status / retry with same key.\n- If still unknown, reconcile or flag for review.\n\n4) Success callback [one DB transaction]\n- Verify callback; lock trade and wallet.\n- If already COMPLETED, acknowledge without changes.\n- Consume reserved cash, credit gold, post ledger entries.\n- Record provider result and mark COMPLETED together.\n- Acknowledge after commit; notify user after commit.\n- Definitive failure: release reserve and mark FAILED.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "BUY Flow\n\n1) Init\n- Read current price; save quote, fees and expiry (30s).\n- Return txid and exact cash / gold amounts.\n\n2) Confirm [one DB transaction]\n- Lock trade, then wallet in consistent order.\n- Check owner, pending status, expiry and available cash.\n- Move cash from available to reserved.\n- Mark PROCESSING. Commit, then return 202.\n- A confirm retry returns the existing trade state.\n\n3) Worker -> Gold Provider\n- Read PROCESSING trades; use stable key per trade.\n- Timeout = unknown. Keep funds reserved.\n- Check provider status / retry with same key.\n- If still unknown, reconcile or flag for review.\n\n4) Success callback [one DB transaction]\n- Verify callback; lock trade and wallet.\n- If already COMPLETED, acknowledge without changes.\n- Consume reserved cash, credit gold, post ledger entries.\n- Record provider result and mark COMPLETED together.\n- Acknowledge after commit; notify user after commit.\n- Definitive failure: release reserve and mark FAILED.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "hasTextLink": false,
      "rawText": "BUY Flow\n\n1) Init\n- Read current price; save quote, fees and expiry (30s).\n- Return txid and exact cash / gold amounts.\n\n2) Confirm [one DB transaction]\n- Lock trade, then wallet in consistent order.\n- Check owner, pending status, expiry and available cash.\n- Move cash from available to reserved.\n- Mark PROCESSING. Commit, then return 202.\n- A confirm retry returns the existing trade state.\n\n3) Worker -> Gold Provider\n- Read PROCESSING trades; use stable key per trade.\n- Timeout = unknown. Keep funds reserved.\n- Check provider status / retry with same key.\n- If still unknown, reconcile or flag for review.\n\n4) Success callback [one DB transaction]\n- Verify callback; lock trade and wallet.\n- If already COMPLETED, acknowledge without changes.\n- Consume reserved cash, credit gold, post ledger entries.\n- Record provider result and mark COMPLETED together.\n- Acknowledge after commit; notify user after commit.\n- Definitive failure: release reserve and mark FAILED."
    },
    {
      "id": "ce65f7bb70194e9ca65032458d3a1da9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3380,
      "y": 2920,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 604722652,
      "version": 27,
      "versionNonce": 9951657,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794666129610,
      "created": 1794666124186,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Example : RM200 buys 0.5 g (no fees)\n- Before : RM1,000 available / RM0 reserved / 0 g\n- Confirm : RM800 available / RM200 reserved / 0 g\n- Success : RM800 available / RM0 reserved / 0.5 g\n- Failure instead : RM1,000 available / RM0 reserved / 0 g\n\nChecks\n- Two buys : second sees the reduced available balance.\n- Duplicate callback : second sees COMPLETED.\n- Crash before commit : retry applies the whole settlement.\n- Crash after commit : retry skips completed settlement.\n- Reconcile provider records against trades + ledger.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Example : RM200 buys 0.5 g (no fees)\n- Before : RM1,000 available / RM0 reserved / 0 g\n- Confirm : RM800 available / RM200 reserved / 0 g\n- Success : RM800 available / RM0 reserved / 0.5 g\n- Failure instead : RM1,000 available / RM0 reserved / 0 g\n\nChecks\n- Two buys : second sees the reduced available balance.\n- Duplicate callback : second sees COMPLETED.\n- Crash before commit : retry applies the whole settlement.\n- Crash after commit : retry skips completed settlement.\n- Reconcile provider records against trades + ledger.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "hasTextLink": false,
      "rawText": "Example : RM200 buys 0.5 g (no fees)\n- Before : RM1,000 available / RM0 reserved / 0 g\n- Confirm : RM800 available / RM200 reserved / 0 g\n- Success : RM800 available / RM0 reserved / 0.5 g\n- Failure instead : RM1,000 available / RM0 reserved / 0 g\n\nChecks\n- Two buys : second sees the reduced available balance.\n- Duplicate callback : second sees COMPLETED.\n- Crash before commit : retry applies the whole settlement.\n- Crash after commit : retry skips completed settlement.\n- Reconcile provider records against trades + ledger."
    }
  ],
